# E §6.3: a ledger compares the model at K "with the observations as known on the model's on date, their same lines,
# links and covers with them" (tally 2.1.8 R12, #169-j; T's fixes/gate/b1_back, the gate's B1). A transfer on two
# statements stated same is one movement in a backtest as at on: konto's and sav's ledgers as known 2026-02-20 (and
# 2026-04-02, before st_sav is known) list it once, observed 950.00 PLN. 2.1.7's refcore read the line and the covers
# at K and counted it twice (1 900.00 PLN).
=== m.tally
model rec
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "synthetic"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

input bank: observed

input amt: money PLN

input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt

ask on_konto: residuals konto 2026-03
ask back_konto: residuals konto 2026-03 as known 2026-02-20
ask on_sav: residuals sav 2026-03
ask back_sav: residuals sav 2026-03 as known 2026-02-20
ask back_between: residuals konto 2026-03 as known 2026-04-02

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 1000.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 5000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  anchor konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "NA OSZCZEDNOSCI"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  anchor sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "Z KONTA"
  same bank[a2] = bank[b1]
=== expect
back_between: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -1 000.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -1 000.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-02
back_konto: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -1 000.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -1 000.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-02-20
back_sav: residuals sav 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-02-20
on_konto: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -1 000.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -1 000.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 50.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
on_sav: residuals sav 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model 1 000.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference -50.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
warning: WARN-NEGATIVE konto is below zero from 2026-06-15
